SUMMARY:Jordan and Mark Rast Duo - Bluegrass Concert to benefit Affordable 
 Housing
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an evening of great music to support the Shiloh Hou
 se affordable housing project in Lancaster. The Jordan and Mark Rast Duo w
 ill perform at Redeemer Lutheran Church on Nov 6 at 7pm to raise money for
  this important project. Free admission with donations accepted for the Sh
 iloh House project. Refreshments to follow concert. Jordan and Mark Rast D
 uo Jordan and Mark are a father/son duo with a shared love for bluegrass a
 nd old-time music —both old and contemporary. They perform on multiple i
 nstruments (fiddle\, banjo\, guitar\, mandolin\, resonator guitar) and inc
 lude both originals and standards in their repertoire. You will hear a var
 iety of instrumental and vocal music when you see them\, all of it perform
 ed with joy! Jordan is an accomplished songwriter and has performed solos 
 as well as many configurations with others over the years. Mark has been a
  long term member of local Bluegrass bands Colebrook Road and Vinegar Cree
 k Constituency. Shiloh House Project The Shiloh House project is a partner
 ship project between Redeemer Lutheran Church and Chestnut Housing\, an af
 fordable housing organization in Lancaster. It will involve creating two a
 ffordable housing units in the former church parsonage at Redeemer. With t
 he support of our friends\, neighbors\, and community\, we will raise the 
 funds needed to complete this important project.\n\nPrice: Not supplied by
  this calendar\; check event details\n\nSchedule listed: Fri\, Nov 06\, 20
 26 07:00 PM EST – Fri\, Nov 06\, 2026 09:00 PM EST\n\nSchedule supplied 
